{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 205,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4168090820312,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations for decentralized care should not preclude hospitalization if appropriate.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        338.5720520019531,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "This review did not include patients requiring surgical care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.40792846679688,
        245.23455810546875,
        124.25992584228516
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        131.35784912109375,
        524.49951171875,
        145.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "Ambulatory care:  The cost varied widely across the modelled settings. The cost per disability-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.6678009033203,
        527.4444580078125,
        159.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "adjusted life year (DALY) averted by an ambulatory model in one setting was sometimes higher than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.86793518066406,
        527.4265747070312,
        172.31092834472656
      ],
      "text": "the cost per DALY averted by a hospitalization model in another setting. However, cost per DALY",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.0679473876953,
        527.4376831054688,
        185.5109405517578
      ],
      "text": "averted was lower under outpatient-based care than under inpatient-based care in the vast majority",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        184.26783752441406,
        527.3602294921875,
        198.71083068847656
      ],
      "text": "(at least 90%) of settings for which cost–effectiveness was modelled. The variation in cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.960578918457031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.4678497314453,
        527.1002807617188,
        211.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "among settings correlated most strongly with the variation in the cost of general health-care services",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995498657226562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.6678009033203,
        527.438720703125,
        225.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "and other non-drug costs. Despite the limitations in the data available, there was no evidence that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.86781311035156,
        527.4199829101562,
        238.31080627441406
      ],
      "text": "conflicted with the recommendation or which indicated that treatment in a hospital-based model of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.0678253173828,
        310.6122131347656,
        251.5108184814453
      ],
      "text": "care leads to a more favourable treatment outcome.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.771728515625,
        527.4310913085938,
        273.2147521972656
      ],
      "text": "The overall cost–effectiveness of care for a patient receiving treatment for MDR-TB can be improved",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.9716796875,
        527.5501098632812,
        286.4147033691406
      ],
      "text": "with an ambulatory model. The benefits include reduced use of resources, and at least as many deaths",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964592933654785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.17169189453125,
        527.40478515625,
        299.6147155761719
      ],
      "text": "avoided among primary and secondary cases as with hospitalization models. This result is based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.3717041015625,
        527.400146484375,
        312.8147277832031
      ],
      "text": "on clinic-based ambulatory treatment (i.e. patients attended a health-care facility); in some settings,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.57171630859375,
        527.4243774414062,
        326.0147399902344
      ],
      "text": "home-based ambulatory treatment (provided by a health worker in the community) might improve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.7716979980469,
        527.4366455078125,
        339.2147216796875
      ],
      "text": "cost– effectiveness even further. The benefit of reduced transmission can be expected only if proper",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.9717102050781,
        527.44970703125,
        352.41473388671875
      ],
      "text": "infection control measures are in place in both the home and the clinic. Potential exposure to people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.17169189453125,
        527.468994140625,
        365.6147155761719
      ],
      "text": "who are infectious can be minimized by reducing or avoiding hospitalization where possible, reducing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972867012023926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.3717041015625,
        527.4365234375,
        378.8147277832031
      ],
      "text": "the number of outpatient visits, avoiding overcrowding in wards and waiting areas, and prioritizing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.29571533203125,
        527.4343872070312,
        392.0147399902344
      ],
      "text": "(134) community-care approaches for TB management  . The regimen used in one of the studies on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.7716979980469,
        527.2595825195312,
        405.2147216796875
      ],
      "text": "ambulatory care derived from a period when the combinations of medicines were not yet optimized,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994647979736328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.9717102050781,
        527.4113159179688,
        418.41473388671875
      ],
      "text": "so the outcomes achieved were probably inferior to those that can be obtained with the regimens in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.17169189453125,
        527.407958984375,
        431.6147155761719
      ],
      "text": "use today. Admission to hospital for patients who do not warrant it may also have important social",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.3717041015625,
        385.80712890625,
        444.8147277832031
      ],
      "text": "and psychological consequences that need to be taken into account.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.0755920410156,
        527.1478881835938,
        466.51861572265625
      ],
      "text": "There may be some important barriers to accessing clinic-based ambulatory care, including distance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949584007263184,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.27569580078125,
        527.5647583007812,
        479.7187194824219
      ],
      "text": "travel and other costs to individual patients. Shifting costs from the service provider to the patient must",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956765174865723,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.4757080078125,
        527.1055297851562,
        492.9187316894531
      ],
      "text": "be avoided, and implementation may need to be accompanied by appropriate enablers. While placing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955660820007324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.67572021484375,
        527.3759155273438,
        506.1187438964844
      ],
      "text": "patients on adequate therapy would be expected to decrease the bacterial load and transmission",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.875732421875,
        527.5828247070312,
        519.3187255859375
      ],
      "text": "of DR-TB, infection control measures for home-based and clinic-based measures will need to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.0755615234375,
        527.4124755859375,
        532.5185546875
      ],
      "text": "part of an ambulatory model of care in order to decrease the risk of transmission in households,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.2756958007812,
        527.4518432617188,
        545.7186889648438
      ],
      "text": "the community and clinics. TB control programmes will have to consider whether they are capable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.4757080078125,
        527.4234619140625,
        558.918701171875
      ],
      "text": "of reallocating resources from hospital care to ambulatory care support in order to undertake the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.6757202148438,
        527.524658203125,
        572.1187133789062
      ],
      "text": "necessary changes in patient management. The choice between these options will affect the feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970610618591309,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.875732421875,
        371.5511169433594,
        585.3187255859375
      ],
      "text": "of implementing the recommendation in a particular programme.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.57958984375,
        527.5825805664062,
        607.0225830078125
      ],
      "text": "A high value was placed on conserving resources and on patient outcomes such as preventing death",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990946769714355,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.7796020507812,
        527.4122314453125,
        620.2225952148438
      ],
      "text": "and transmission of MDR-TB as a result of delayed diagnosis and inpatient treatment. There should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.9796142578125,
        527.373046875,
        633.422607421875
      ],
      "text": "always be provision for a back-up facility to manage patients who need inpatient treatment. This may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993698120117188,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.1796264648438,
        527.4081420898438,
        646.6226196289062
      ],
      "text": "be necessary in certain groups of patients at particular risk, such as children during the intensive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.379638671875,
        455.5218811035156,
        659.8226318359375
      ],
      "text": "phase, among whom close monitoring may be required for a certain period of time.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        666.9736328125,
        527.3006591796875,
        681.526611328125
      ],
      "text": "Decentralized care:  National TB programmes should have standardized guidelines regarding which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.994248390197754,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.2835083007812,
        527.407958984375,
        694.7265014648438
      ],
      "text": "patients are eligible for decentralized care. Patient preference should be given a high value when",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.4835205078125,
        310.2447814941406,
        707.926513671875
      ],
      "text": "choosing between centralized or decentralized care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.1875,
        527.5328369140625,
        729.6304931640625
      ],
      "text": "Decentralized care for MDR-TB patients requires appropriate treatment supervision, patient education",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965696334838867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.3873901367188,
        527.1865234375,
        742.8303833007812
      ],
      "text": "and social support, staff training, infection control practices and quality assurance. The optimal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.5875244140625,
        527.4036254882812,
        756.030517578125
      ],
      "text": "treatment supervision options and treatment adherence interventions recommended in section 2.1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        754.7874755859375,
        370.7019348144531,
        769.23046875
      ],
      "text": "should be considered for MDR-TB patients on decentralized care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 191",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}